
/*
 * Vula! Print updater authorization
 *
 * Passwordless Polkit authorization is intentionally disabled.
 *
 * The updater services currently execute installer code from a
 * user-writable checkout. Do not grant local users permission to
 * start these privileged services until the updater trust boundary
 * has been redesigned and verified.
 *
 * Administrative updates must currently be performed only by an
 * authorized administrator. This file intentionally defines no
 * authorization rules.
 */
